{"3839850": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Crystal of Atlan", "steam_appid": 3839850, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839850/extras/9893f133f0733b70d69857222d2f547b.poster.avif?t=1765437343\" width=662 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839850/extras/9893f133f0733b70d69857222d2f547b.webm?t=1765437343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839850/extras/9893f133f0733b70d69857222d2f547b.mp4?t=1765437343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crystal of Atlan is a magicpunk MMO action RPG that supports cross-platform play between PC and mobile. The game centers on high-speed combos and three-dimensional combat, delivering a combat experience that combines both tactile satisfaction and strategic depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DYNAMIC AIR COMBO COMBAT! Master fast-paced 3D combat even in the air.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break free from traditional ground-based combat! Chain combos from ground to air, combined with perfected airborne dodging, knockback collisions, and environmental interactions. Experience smooth combat like never before as you fill up the screen with dazzling visual effects and ignite your warrior within with hard-hitting skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839850/extras/6f1e0b0f71a62c0281c91b6a1fb431ce.poster.avif?t=1765437343\" width=662 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839850/extras/6f1e0b0f71a62c0281c91b6a1fb431ce.webm?t=1765437343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THRILLING FAIR PVP SHOWDOWNS! Dominate in PVP battles based on skill and mastery!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer PvP gameplay that emphasizes technical mastery and fair duels. In 1v1 Ranked Matches or 3v3 Team Battles, all players compete on equal footing with identical stats. Victory depends on execution, combo timing, and team coordination—true champions speak through skill alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839850/extras/dc8ea4f2277864b60041a0be60a15143.poster.avif?t=1765437343\" width=662 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839850/extras/dc8ea4f2277864b60041a0be60a15143.webm?t=1765437343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DISTINCTIVE CLASSES AND SKILLS! Customize skills with 10+ classes available!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose freely from 5 base classes and 11 class branch options! Each class possesses over 20 skills that can be mixed and matched to build different combo rotations and playstyles for different combat roles. Find your very own build and playstyle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839850/extras/6891070e29fa7a4dafc8d4dea7b2d0db.poster.avif?t=1765437343\" width=662 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839850/extras/6891070e29fa7a4dafc8d4dea7b2d0db.webm?t=1765437343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839850/extras/6891070e29fa7a4dafc8d4dea7b2d0db.mp4?t=1765437343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHALLENGING TEAM BATTLES! Experience dungeons with strategic teamwork.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An adventure is never done alone. Form teams and challenge co-op dungeons at any time! Fight bosses with unique mechanics and triumph over them with teamwork and coordination between classes! Fight together and share the glory and loot with your team! Team work makes the dream work!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839850/extras/0e193e70ca820d3e0ba468460ddff5a9.poster.avif?t=1765437343\" width=662 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839850/extras/0e193e70ca820d3e0ba468460ddff5a9.webm?t=1765437343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839850/extras/0e193e70ca820d3e0ba468460ddff5a9.mp4?t=1765437343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNIQUE MAGICPUNK WORLD! Immerse yourself in a magicpunk adventure.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the floating islands of Atlan, where magic and technology intertwine. As a member of the Adventurer's Guild, you'll delve into ruins, battle Decayed monsters, forge alliances, and uncover the truth of forgone civilizations, leading the world back to order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839850/extras/c28d87fe7cb73ad9a7226229a49b8136.poster.avif?t=176543734